{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/a9923e77b3c0acc0feba12e07561d076.avif?t=1773677090\" width=1051 height=179 /></span>Restore the world with your hands, your heart, and just a touch of magic. Watch seeds turn into trees and the desert turn into a green oasis. Feel the change as it happens: warm breezes ripple through freshly sprouted meadows, frogs return to singing wetlands, and it finally rains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/9bb03adc7a8ff6e0f0893a650d235c4d.poster.avif?t=1773677090\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/9bb03adc7a8ff6e0f0893a650d235c4d.webm?t=1773677090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/9bb03adc7a8ff6e0f0893a650d235c4d.mp4?t=1773677090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/48866c89a95be2855d0d0b9a2bdee02b.webp?t=1773677090\" width=1051 height=61 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant &amp; Cultivate:</strong> Discover new seeds, choose which animal habitats to restore, learn powerful plant synergies, and create beautiful living biomes according to your vision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle &amp; Craft:</strong> Clean up old junk to collect crafting materials and upcycle them into beautiful decorations for your home, or powerful watering systems for your plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend Folklore Spirits: </strong>Meet mythical nature spirits willing to give you mighty abilities in exchange for your help (and maybe a few shiny objects.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the Fruits of Your Care:\u00a0</strong>Harvest flowers and berries to plant in new areas or to give as gifts to your favourite animals and friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/3e9993dc37883f607defc3689c38d762.poster.avif?t=1773677090\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/3e9993dc37883f607defc3689c38d762.webm?t=1773677090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/3e9993dc37883f607defc3689c38d762.mp4?t=1773677090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/65033684658c91cf8b5887e1c7f333a7.avif?t=1773677090\" width=1051 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Stress-free: no timers, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Feel your impact! Everything you do helps nature recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Rich atmosphere: adaptive soundtrack + ASMR-like nature sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Intuitive mechanics with folklore storytelling.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419080?t=1773677090","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419080?t=1773677090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/4ed09463ab9ee3f704755a7d801f73d9a0088515/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773677090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama